      "statement": "The offer link is built on the /receive route with query params s (encoded offer SDP, required), i (ICE server override — the shared-predicate-resolved value, omitted when equal to the default), c (chunk size, omitted when default), and p (base64 SPKI RSA public key from the once-per-offer-minted keypair, only when encryption is on); empty values are dropped by buildURL.",
