    {
      "id": "claim_5b41d4320b424ab8ab56a4606ddf1ead",
      "statement": "The offer peer creates the data channel (ordered:false) and the answer peer receives it via ondatachannel; both install the same handlePeerMessage handler from src/utils/peerMessage.ts (deduplicated from two identical per-page handlers, PR #71) with Message.decode on peer-controlled bytes guarded by try/catch (toast + drop the frame instead of an uncaught crash, PR #46) and unlock the Send/Receive transfer UI on channel open. Both pages additionally wire the channel's onerror/onclose to sender?.onChannelClose()/receiver?.onChannelClose() so a dead channel propagates the connection-lost state into the file pipelines (PR #74).",
