      "id": "claim_f494c80366444f64ad561e77fc827565",
      "statement": "QR exchange replaces keyboard entry: QrModal renders the offer link or answer code as a QR (byte mode, US-ASCII ECI 27, error-correction level M, auto version) via buildQrDataUrl in src/utils/qr.ts with the data URL $derived from the qrData prop so re-generating the offer never shows a stale mount-time QR (PR #53), and ScanQrModal decodes a counterparty QR from the camera, feeding the decoded text back through the same accept/copy path as pasting; the scanner is stopped explicitly on the programmatic close/success path (stop() in the decode callback and in onDestroy) so the camera stream + decode worker are released, and both modals use per-instance DOM ids so multiple modals on one page never share toggles or video elements.",
